{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 5500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1480, "text": "Well, Mac, it's a 2 ,000 -foot putt.\nWhat do you think?"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 8580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 6100, "text": "I'd use your number three woodpecker,\nsir."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 14220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 12660, "text": "Off with his head!"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 19940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 16079, "text": "Hey, Stone, don't you know it's illegal\nto use a hopped -up ball?"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 21760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 20760, "text": "That's it!"}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 25120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 22000, "text": "Hey, Harry, how do two sailors greet\neach other?"}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 27540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25380, "text": "With a naval salute!"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 32310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31310, "text": "Naval salute."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 33850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 32549, "text": "Oh, yes, sir."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 35650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 34090, "text": "I'm howling on the inside."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 41930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 37490, "text": "Harry, I'd like you to meet Jimmy\nCleaver. He's working here now."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 45990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42190, "text": "Hi, Jimmy. Very nice to meet you. Gee,\nthey're making our interns younger and"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 47330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 45990, "text": "younger all the time, aren't they?"}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 49730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47590, "text": "He's not an intern. He's a judge."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 53110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 51850, "text": "You are a judge?"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 55350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 53470, "text": "Hey, it's okay. I brought a note from my\nparents."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 59910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 56730, "text": "I'm sorry, Jimmy. I used to get that\nkind of stuff all the time myself. You"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 62190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 59910, "text": "know, when I was appointed, I was the\nyoungest judge ever."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 63690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 62690, "text": "34."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 64789, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 63790, "text": "I'm 33."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 73010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 68490, "text": "This is such a thrill for me, sir. I\nhave been a fan of yours ever since I"}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 74010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 73010, "text": "little kid."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 75230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74210, "text": "That long, huh?"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 78330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76410, "text": "Sir, you're like a law school legend."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 83190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 78970, "text": "I mean, you're the man responsible for\nthe whoopee podium, the exploding"}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 86630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 83250, "text": "not to mention my personal favorite, the\ncombustible toilet paper."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 90910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 87810, "text": "Well, it did help the dean set the state\nhigh jump record."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 98690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92210, "text": "Hey, Harry, I think young Jimmy here\ncould use some of your special candy."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 100790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 99530, "text": "Sure, sure, sure."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 104750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 101110, "text": "Hey, Jimmy, maybe you'd like to try a\nlittle..."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 106580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 105580, "text": "Peanut burrito?"}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 108520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 107140, "text": "Oh, sure, I'd love some."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 116000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 113600, "text": "Gee, that used to just jump right up."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 118820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 116780, "text": "My world and welcome to it."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 127600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 125620, "text": "You know, sir, the new ones don't do\nthat."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 130740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 127980, "text": "They have microchip -controlled titanium\nsprings."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 133940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 131720, "text": "Oh, well, that's great if you want one\nthat..."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 135770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 134570, "text": "works every time."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 141030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 136770, "text": "That's my texture. Without it, today's\nprankster is a dinosaur."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 144210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 141830, "text": "Well, I gotta go be a judge."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 146770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 145670, "text": "Good luck, Jimmy."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 151510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 147070, "text": "Real nice meeting you. Real nice. Real,\nreal, real nice."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 154170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 152510, "text": "I hate his guts."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 158630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 155190, "text": "Where does he get off being so young?"}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 162090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 158990, "text": "Come on, Harry. Don't be such a fucker\nbutt."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 170080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 163550, "text": "You know, After 68 years and three heart\nattacks, I can tell you fun is the best"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 171260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 170080, "text": "revenge. Here."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 174800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 172740, "text": "Blow my brains to Brooklyn."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 179280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 177620, "text": "No, I'm not in the mood."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 183780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 179880, "text": "Ah, come on. Your mother wears combat\nboots. Forget it."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 187300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 184380, "text": "Your head is shaped like a bedpan."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 188600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 187600, "text": "It ain't gonna work."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 191780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 189420, "text": "Mel Torme is a woman."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 208880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 203280, "text": "Harry, do you mind if I... Two thousand\nbucks a week, my lips are sealed."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 258339, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254440, "text": "I can't stand how gloomy Harry's been\nsince Judge Sims died."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 261500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 258720, "text": "It just tears my heart out to think he\nblames himself."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 263360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262019, "text": "It wasn't Harry's fault."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 266640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 263700, "text": "He just... Pulled the trigger and Judge\nSims dropped dead."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 272800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268980, "text": "Dan, the doctor said that the dark gun\nhad nothing to do with it. He died of a"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 273619, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 272800, "text": "heart attack."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 278220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273620, "text": "We gotta do something to cheer Harry up.\nThe last two weeks he's been so..."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 280780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 278220, "text": "unspunky."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 283960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 282960, "text": "All rise."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 286750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 284430, "text": "Manhattan Criminal Court Part 2 is now\nin session."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 292810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 287110, "text": "The formerly fun -loving, but lately\npretty darn depressing,"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 295830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 293150, "text": "Merrill T. Stone presiding."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 297070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 296070, "text": "Be seated."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 300810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 297930, "text": "Or stand up. I don't give a damn."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 306730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 301610, "text": "Sir, look, you've got to get Judge Sims\nout of your mind. I can't, Mac."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 311650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306990, "text": "They did such a cheesy job putting up\nthe dent in his forehead."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 315800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 314160, "text": "Try to bear up, sir."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 319860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 317100, "text": "First case, people versus grubs."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 322460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 321460, "text": "Attempted robbery."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 332200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 329520, "text": "Judge, sludge."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 339960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335780, "text": "Don't fight the feeling, sir. Any joke\nyou can come up with, just let her rip."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 342180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341120, "text": "What's the charge?"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 347970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 345870, "text": "Oh, I can't stand it."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 350170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348210, "text": "Oh, you're back, sir."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 357730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 352830, "text": "Mr. Prosecutor? Yes, sir. Well, the\nWizard of Ooze here..."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 364290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 357730, "text": "Continue. Well, he robbed a tour boat,"}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 368010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364510, "text": "and while trying to make his escape, the\nDuke of Oil..."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 377810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373870, "text": "Caught in the ship's tow line and was\ndragged through six miles of raw sewage."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 381070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 378370, "text": "The muck stops here."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 386410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 385410, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 393990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 387050, "text": "sir, my client pleads guilty, but he\ndoes pray that you will let him... Let"}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 399650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 393990, "text": "off the... Let him off the..."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 410480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 409480, "text": "over for trial?"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 412380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 410580, "text": "I'm the defender."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 415280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 413520, "text": "Put a sock in it."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 416500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 415500, "text": "Sorry."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 418460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417460, "text": "That's it?"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 423380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 418560, "text": "I stay conscious for three hours to hear\nthe legendary Harry Stone?"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 425580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 423700, "text": "And that's the best you can do?"}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 428780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426080, "text": "Where's the scintillating repartee?"}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 435200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 430420, "text": "I'm real sorry, sir, but this is not the\ntime or the place for mindless"}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 436300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 435200, "text": "frivolity."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 453050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 451790, "text": "The wheels of justice."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 457910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 454830, "text": "Look, Cleaver. Hey, nice robe, Judge."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 459250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 458250, "text": "Is that silk?"}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 462030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459270, "text": "They give us new and alert judges\npolyester."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 464870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463130, "text": "Forget the robe, Cleaver."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 469250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465270, "text": "I will not have you disrupting the\nsolemn dignity of my courtroom."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 473790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 469650, "text": "Whoa, this from the man who once\npresided in a Puff the Magic Dragon"}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 479910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 475310, "text": "Well, that's true, but there was a\npretty darn good reason for that. It"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 483810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 481230, "text": "Mac, what was the pretty darn good\nreason for that?"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 486230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 484190, "text": "Your King Kong suit was in the cleaner,\nsir."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 489070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 488070, "text": "See?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 494550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489730, "text": "But recent events have shown me that\nlife is not a game."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 500290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 495050, "text": "These people want more from their judges\nthan just cheap sideshow theatrics."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 506090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 501250, "text": "Well, then I guess they won't want to\nsee me eat a flaming gavel."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 515840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 513799, "text": "Big deal. Harry's done that a hundred\ntimes."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 517740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516700, "text": "No, he hasn't."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 520320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 519320, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 527500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 524900, "text": "So the nun says 20 bucks. Same as in\ntown."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 532580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 530240, "text": "Boy, he sure is charming the crowd."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 534060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532820, "text": "Oh, that's nothing."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 539260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 534280, "text": "Harry's got more charm, more charisma,\nmore pizzazz than any three of him."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 541640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 539680, "text": "Dag nabbit, they were out of prunes."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 545240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544240, "text": "Settle for bran buds."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 547820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 546820, "text": "Bran buds?"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 553220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 548380, "text": "Yeah, roughage, Mac, roughage. You be\ngood to your colon, it'll be good to"}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 556060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 554920, "text": "It's good to have a hobby."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 562080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 561080, "text": "Abracadabra."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 599030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 596650, "text": "I can't believe anybody would find that\nfunny."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 604170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 599590, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 612010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 610630, "text": "So, you've, um..."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 618850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612010, "text": "given me a woman's chest. Very"}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 620130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 618850, "text": "funny. I'm surprised you didn't..."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 629270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 627850, "text": "Excuse me, I'm going to go check on\nsomething."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 635110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 632150, "text": "Say, Judge Stone, why don't you try one?"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 642330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 638270, "text": "No, thanks. I make it a practice never\nto follow an erupting bosom ass."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 647870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 643190, "text": "Come on, you can do it, sir. I don't\nwant to. You have to. Come on, give the"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 648549, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 647870, "text": "a break."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 651410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 648550, "text": "Let him wander off to pasture\ngracefully."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 654010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 652730, "text": "No hard feelings, Judge."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 660320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 659160, "text": "Okay, all right."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 664480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660860, "text": "Yeah, Cleaver, let's shake hands and be\nfriends, huh?"}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 667400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 664760, "text": "Whoa! Well, what do we have here?"}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 670240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 667620, "text": "Is this a prehistoric joy buzzer?"}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 676160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 670660, "text": "No offense, Judge, but this is the 80s.\nLet me show you the state of the art."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 690320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689200, "text": "Good, because I don't fool easy."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 696799, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 695880, "text": "That's enough."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 697800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 696800, "text": "Stop."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 703680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 701960, "text": "Bull, are you okay?"}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 705900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 704900, "text": "You got a cigarette?"}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 710180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 708180, "text": "The wave of the future, Harry."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 714760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 710540, "text": "Wake up and smell the rubber bar. Now,\nhey, wait a minute. Now, you cannot talk"}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 718620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 714760, "text": "to him like that. He can out -joke you\nwith one whoopee cushion tied behind his"}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 722570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 718620, "text": "back. Yeah, if he wanted to, he could\npull a stunt that would make your jaw"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 725730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722570, "text": "scrape your toenails. Well, that sounds\nlike a challenge."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 727310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 725950, "text": "You're darn tootin' it's a challenge!"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 731250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 727510, "text": "The two of you, head to head, and may\nthe best joke win."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 733690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 731630, "text": "What do you think, Judge? A battle of\nprank?"}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 735210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 734090, "text": "I'm game if you are."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 741550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736390, "text": "Well, I'd love to, I'd love to, but you\nknow, I've got this darn irregularity."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 746570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 742890, "text": "Hey, hey, I understand. You're just not\nfeeling up to it."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 747910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 746830, "text": "Well, I gotta go."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 752420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 748320, "text": "I hear my first case is a skydiving\nhooker. So much for free fall."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 757360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 756360, "text": "Sir,"}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 763540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 761400, "text": "I cannot believe you didn't take the\nchallenge."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 764960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763820, "text": "Where is your pride?"}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 768040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 765400, "text": "Rip his guts out and use them for\ngarters, sir."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 771820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 770820, "text": "Metaphorically speaking."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 774100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772900, "text": "Don't you guys understand?"}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 775680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 774320, "text": "I don't want to beat Cleaver."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 777480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 775880, "text": "I just want to spend my..."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 782390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 777930, "text": "Few remaining days in peaceful\ncontemplation."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 785370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 784350, "text": "What's that?"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 787550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 785630, "text": "Coming from Cleaver's briefcase."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 817730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814510, "text": "joke challenge i had no idea they were\ngoing to booby trap the whole place"}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 853750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 852330, "text": "and he dislodged that carpet tack."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 863990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862990, "text": "Hi, Matt."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 865950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 864950, "text": "Evening, ladies."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 871130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 870070, "text": "How's the battle zone?"}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 873710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 872050, "text": "Frankly, I'm getting a little tired of\nit."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 877730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 874050, "text": "Yeah, just once I'd like to sit in a\nchair without sounding like my Uncle"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 879030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 877730, "text": "after Thanksgiving dinner."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 885160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 883020, "text": "I talked to Harry, but I haven't seen\nhim."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 886500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 885500, "text": "Hi, guys!"}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 888700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887700, "text": "Harry!"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 892180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 891180, "text": "Ha -ha!"}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 896280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892700, "text": "Oh, I know you're disappointed because I\nwent up to a buck and a half, huh?"}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 902260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 897560, "text": "Oh, Harry, it's so gratifying to see you\nback to your mindless juvenile ways"}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 903260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 902260, "text": "again."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 904920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 903320, "text": "Pretty neat disguise, huh?"}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 908300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905280, "text": "Cleaver can't catch me if he can't find\nme."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 914970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 913550, "text": "Matt, get the women folk to cover."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 920570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 915930, "text": "I'm tired of all this pussy hooting\naround, Stone. Let's go for the big"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 923890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 920850, "text": "One shot, one joke, winner take all."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 926510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 924390, "text": "Fine with me, beaver."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 931070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 927170, "text": "You got enough gumption, boy, to make a\nlittle wager on who's gonna win?"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 932910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 931390, "text": "Or are you yellow?"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 935010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 934010, "text": "I'm a man."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 937950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 935450, "text": "Hard as nails, tough as a two -bit\nsteak."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 940870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 938230, "text": "And if I win, I wanna go to the circus."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 948500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 943400, "text": "If I win, I want one of those nice silk\nrobes. Kind of symbolic, you know, the"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 949720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 948500, "text": "changing of the guard."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 953380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950120, "text": "Okie doke. Good. Your courtroom tonight."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 955840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953860, "text": "9 .15 exactly."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 958380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 956880, "text": "9 .15 tonight."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 959700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 958700, "text": "Fine."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 961600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 960600, "text": "For what?"}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 966100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 962080, "text": "That is when I'm going to prove once and\nfor all which one of us is the real"}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 967660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966100, "text": "nabob of nuttiness."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 971900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 968140, "text": "Because you'll know where it's going to\nhappen. You'll know when it's going to"}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 976080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 971900, "text": "happen. But you won't know what's going\nto happen. And there ain't nothing,"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 979000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976300, "text": "nothing you can do to stop it."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 981900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 980900, "text": "Sir,"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 985520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 984120, "text": "I don't like this."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 986800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 985800, "text": "I don't either, sir."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 990140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 986940, "text": "Oh, come on now. What's the worst that\ncould possibly happen?"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 1002790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1001130, "text": "The motorcycle gang broke his fall."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 1005090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1004510, "text": "All"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 1012190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1005090, "text": "rise."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 1015210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012650, "text": "Manhattan Criminal Court Part 2 is now\nin session."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 1017590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1015510, "text": "The Honorable Harold T. Stone presiding."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 1021170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1018550, "text": "Perhaps for the last time."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 1024710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1022810, "text": "It's almost 9 .15. Mac, how's it look?"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 1026930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025930, "text": "It's quiet."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 1029170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1028170, "text": "Too quiet."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 1031589, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1030569, "text": "me and stay low."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 1037430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1036190, "text": "Does everything check out?"}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 1039150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038150, "text": "It's perfect."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 1041329, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040329, "text": "Too perfect."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 1044450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1043109, "text": "Don't let your guard down."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 1045849, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1044849, "text": "Right."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 1048270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1046230, "text": "Okay, we might as well get started."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 1049630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1048630, "text": "How's the docket?"}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 1050790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1049790, "text": "It's busy."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 1053370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1052370, "text": "Too busy."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 1055810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1054810, "text": "That's easy."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 1057690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1056210, "text": "Just call the first cake."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 1059010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1058010, "text": "Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 1061350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1059310, "text": "People versus bogs, sir."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 1063010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1061830, "text": "Mr. Prosecutor."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 1067410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1063390, "text": "Uh, yeah, she was arrested for selling\nflowers without the necessary permit,"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 1068570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1067570, "text": "sir."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 1070410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1068910, "text": "What are you doing, Dan?"}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 1075190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1071870, "text": "Do the words innocent bystander ring a\nbell?"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 1078890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076750, "text": "Get it up here, Fielding."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 1083930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1080010, "text": "Defense. Your Honor, my client is merely\na flower lover who happens to sell an"}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 1086130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1083930, "text": "occasional bouquet on the street to help\npay her rent."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1092590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1089390, "text": "Clever, didn't you, Cleaver? You didn't\nthink I would know that the flowers"}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1094350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1092590, "text": "contained an incendiary device."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1099150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1094830, "text": "Because, because, because they, because\nthey, they don't."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1102650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1100430, "text": "I think I'm going to faint."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1105150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1103090, "text": "Must be glad you weren't selling\nkittens."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1113430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1110130, "text": "Getting a little nervous, Judge Doan?"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1115150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1114150, "text": "Who, me?"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1118490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115310, "text": "Your hollow threats don't frighten me,\nCleaver."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1119890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1118890, "text": "Sir? What?"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1123510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1120470, "text": "Ten seconds. It'll be 9 .15."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1125450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1124230, "text": "Quick, sir, sign this."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1127610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125710, "text": "What is it? An organ donor card."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1132130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1130910, "text": "Five seconds."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1133730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1132730, "text": "Four."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1135210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1134210, "text": "Three."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1137150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1136150, "text": "Two."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1139110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1138110, "text": "One."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1158190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1153230, "text": "Oh, you made a lot of noise. Yes, you\nmade a lot of noise. But in the end, you"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1160470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1158190, "text": "couldn't unthrone the champ."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1162630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161550, "text": "Ten -minute recess."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1169510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168510, "text": "Gotcha."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1191250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1190250, "text": "It's not over yet."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1195950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194590, "text": "Yeah, it is."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1199070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196390, "text": "What? Well, I can't top that."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1202610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1200870, "text": "Nobody could top that."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1204830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1203270, "text": "So you're just giving up?"}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1207590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205050, "text": "I'm not giving up. He beat me."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1211710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209330, "text": "Congratulations, champ."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1213910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1212130, "text": "I'll go get your robe."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1217130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1214230, "text": "The one you're wearing will be fine,\nJudge."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1220390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1217550, "text": "What? You can't just take the robe off\nthe man's back."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1222270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220710, "text": "At least leave him a little dignity."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1223590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1222570, "text": "It doesn't matter."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1226930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1225630, "text": "Nothing matters."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1231550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1229010, "text": "I hope you get a rash."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1238150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1235210, "text": "In that secret place I can't bring\nmyself to mention."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1244150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1243150, "text": "Unbelievable."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1247090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1244990, "text": "I never saw that coming."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1249780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1248120, "text": "Sir, don't worry about your bench."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1252380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1250020, "text": "I have a TV tray you can use until you\nget a new one."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1255040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1254040, "text": "Thanks."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1256740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1255320, "text": "It has Care Bears on it."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1260440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1258680, "text": "It's not the bench, Miss Sullivan."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1262160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1261160, "text": "It's me."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1265960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1262580, "text": "Do you know what the odds are against a\nstunt like that working?"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1267220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1266220, "text": "They're astronomical."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1270340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1267400, "text": "I never would have tried something like\nthat."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1273020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1270780, "text": "Of course you would have, sir."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1274280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1273280, "text": "Oh, no, not anymore."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1276140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1274680, "text": "I wouldn't have had the confidence."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1281630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1278090, "text": "Good God, Miss Sullivan, I am not young\nanymore."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1287430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1282990, "text": "Well, sir, none of us can stay the same\nage, but there are a lot of"}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1288690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1287430, "text": "compensations for getting older."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1295730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289610, "text": "Well, it's given me a certain measure of\nexperience and the wisdom to accept my"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1302270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295730, "text": "limitations and the cunning to lure that\nlittle twerp right into my"}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1303270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1302270, "text": "trap."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1307310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1305290, "text": "So, how's the robe look?"}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1308820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1307660, "text": "You look very judicial."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1310620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309620, "text": "Wait a minute."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1311880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1310880, "text": "Something's happened."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1365690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1362830, "text": "You may be faster. You may even be\nsmarter."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1370510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1366030, "text": "But you will never, ever be crazier"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1373650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1370510, "text": "than me."}
